SUMMARY:The Thursday Bluegrass Jam hosted by Drew Matulich
DESCRIPTION:Our amazing Thursday BlueGrass jam curated by the talented Drew Matulich! Don’t miss your chance to check out some of the best pickers from all over WNC! A real show-stopping performance only at Jack of the Wood! The Bluegrass Jam will start after the host band at 9:30 and go to 11:30pm. Pickers bring your instruments! Enjoy $1 OFF all our bourbons every Thursday \nJack Of The Wood is still a downtown hot spot for food\, brews and drink since 1997 and founders Joan and Joe Eckert who still own it\, have maintained the original lively English and Irish vibe. The old-time mountain and Irish music jams continue\, including a hot bluegrass jam Thursdays and brunch every Sunday. The venue extends a welcoming feeling to regulars and newcomers to this day. https://jackofthewood.com/
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/the-thursday-bluegrass-jam-hosted-by-drew-matulich-2-2-2-2-2-2-2-2/2026-04-16/
LOCATION:Jack Of The Wood\, 95 Patton Ave\, asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music,Open MIc/Jam
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/IMG_0947-e1750964014171.jpeg
GEO:35.5944492;-82.5558221
