SUMMARY:Crowbar Blues ft. Melissa McKinney & Chris Everett
DESCRIPTION:Winners of the MerleFest band competition in 2025\, an annual competition that is a significant event at the long-running roots music festival\, Melissa McKinney & Chris Everett are lighting up the stage @crowbaravl on Thursday nights. Join us at 92 Patton Ave from 9pm-12am! \n  \nThe Crowbar – Asheville’s Best Flockin’ Bar 🐦‍⬛Live Music Every Thursday & Saturday 🎶Sun – Thurs | 1pm to 1amFri – Sat | 1pm to 2am \nDrinks\, Snacks\, Games\, Live Music\, DJ’s\, Karaoke\, More
