SUMMARY:Against The Grain: Gluten Free Sips & Small Plates ft. Shadow In The Moon
DESCRIPTION:Our friends at Red Fiddle Vittles are delivering a full spread of tasty treats\, both salty and sweet\, and you’re invited! Entry to the event is based on a suggested donation of $30-$50 to be paid upon arrival. Proceeds benefit Food Connection. Your entry also grants you access to unlimited samples from our beverage partners plus live acoustic music with Shadow In The Moon.\nIf you’ve been looking to expand your GF options\, or simply want to treat yourself to an all-you-CAN-eat experience\, this gathering is for you!\nWe hope you’ll join us.\nPre-registration is required for entry as space is limited. Please click here! and we’ll confirm your registration.\n  \n\n\n‘The Mule’ – Tasting Room \n\n\n\n\n\nSay hello to The Mule – a full-service bar/event space in the home of Devil’s Foot Beverage’s production facility. Draft soda\, beer\, & wine – as well as delicious cocktails & mocktails featuring Devil’s Foot craft sodas and the largest collection of NC-made spirits in Asheville – all at your fingertips just outside of Biltmore Village! Open now for all of your beverage & party needs! devilsfootbrew.com/the-mule
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/against-the-grain-gluten-free-sips-small-plates-ft-shadow-in-the-moon/
LOCATION:The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages\, 131 Sweeten Creek Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-13-112134-e1776093724383.png
GEO:35.5588369;-82.5218977
